Patch intent: Add Guix community template entries

Add draft R4.3 community template release-config entries for a
builder-guix component and the guix and guix-minimal templates.

The entries follow the existing community template pattern: the builder
component does not publish packages, templates use dist: guix, and
guix-minimal is expressed as the minimal flavor of the same distribution.

The public builder-guix repository URL remains placeholder review metadata.
Maintainer/signing metadata is intentionally left out of this RFC sketch; it
belongs to the eventual publication request, not the first review pass.

Validation:
Parsed R4.3/qubes-os-r4.3-templates-community.yml with PyYAML and
verified builder-guix, guix, guix-minimal, minimal flavor, and
21600-second template timeouts.
---
 R4.3/qubes-os-r4.3-templates-community.yml | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

